#: ../../source/docs/common_baro_thrust_compensation.rst:7
#: eac33449bcda4dd697e51d3abf7f78cf
msgid "Thrust Compensation of Barometer"
msgstr "气压计的推力补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/common_baro_thrust_compensation.rst:9
#: e47cd8682cf446bca09420f7e89a6738
msgid ""
"this features is not included on most ArduPilot standard firmware builds. "
"Use the `custom firmware build server <custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to create a "
"firmware that includes it."
msgstr ""
"大多数 ArduPilot 标准固件不包含此功能。请使用 `自定义固件构建服务器 <custom.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"创建包含该功能的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common_baro_thrust_compensation.rst:11
#: 95c54641a738413ca2ecfc61adeacee2
msgid ""
"On very small multirotors, the autopilot's barometer might be in the prop "
"wash and have its readings impacted by that pressure which will vary with "
"respect to the thrust (Throttle) being produced."
msgstr "在非常小的多旋翼上，飞控的气压计可能处于桨流之中，其读数会受到桨流压力的影响，而该压力会随所产生的推力（油门）变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common_baro_thrust_compensation.rst:16
#: ab7ae2c6c24c4804a801c779f456579a
msgid ""
"The first barometer (BARO1) can have compensation applied as a linearly "
"varying offset of throttle value to reduce this effect. The "
":ref:`BARO1_THST_SCALE<BARO1_THST_SCALE>` parameters determines the "
"magnitude, and sign, of the offset and will need to be experimentally "
"determined for a particular vehicle. Examining the the log messages for "
"``BARO1.Press`` vs ``BARO1.CPress`` (compensated atmospheric pressure) can "
"be used for this."
msgstr ""
"可对第一个气压计（BARO1）施加补偿，即一个随油门值线性变化的偏移量，以减小该影响。:ref:`BARO1_THST_SCALE<BARO1_THST_SCALE>`"
" 参数决定该偏移量的大小和符号，需针对具体飞行器通过实验确定。为此可检查日志消息中的 ``BARO1.Press`` 与 "
"``BARO1.CPress`` （补偿后的大气压）。"
